// IntroString :
"P3929842267" "A great power is descending upon us, {VillainName}. According to my network of sources, a powerful Circle of Thorns mystic known as Senestrus has come to Grandville. I need to know whether those sources are correct. You will go to a certain Circle stronghold I know and beat the truth out of them. If you hear anything of Senestrus, bring the information to me at once."
// AcceptString :
"P2460103259" "Investigate Circle stronghold"
// SendOffString :
"P2133375029" "Senestrus is a foul being, but one of inordinate power. Be careful."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1385640835" "Beat coven leader & his guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P551187905" "I want to know when we can expect Senestrus."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3452257944" "You step once more into the ancient halls of Oranbega. As always, you have the feeling you're being watched."

